    "detailed_description": "SUPER SPACE ARCADE is a 3D reinterpretation of the retro arcade shooter experience! Get ready for non-stop action as you jump, dodge and blast your way through heaps of colorful enemies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/ea6d61358dfb623af756efcf66fc6858.poster.avif?t=1753120477\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/ea6d61358dfb623af756efcf66fc6858.webm?t=1753120477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/ea6d61358dfb623af756efcf66fc6858.mp4?t=1753120477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>As you progress through the levels, the challenges will become more intense and the rewards greater. Power up with a variety of upgrades and special abilities, including laser beams, invincibility shields, and more. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/f41aa24e6f3354cde967683c91b7089d.poster.avif?t=1753120477\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/f41aa24e6f3354cde967683c91b7089d.webm?t=1753120477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/f41aa24e6f3354cde967683c91b7089d.mp4?t=1753120477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Note: The Demo version of this game only includes the &quot;endless&quot; highscore mode. Later versions will feature a more roguelike progression over various levels.<br><br>Join the game and see how far you can go!",
    "about_the_game": "SUPER SPACE ARCADE is a 3D reinterpretation of the retro arcade shooter experience! Get ready for non-stop action as you jump, dodge and blast your way through heaps of colorful enemies.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/ea6d61358dfb623af756efcf66fc6858.poster.avif?t=1753120477\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/ea6d61358dfb623af756efcf66fc6858.webm?t=1753120477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/ea6d61358dfb623af756efcf66fc6858.mp4?t=1753120477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>As you progress through the levels, the challenges will become more intense and the rewards greater. Power up with a variety of upgrades and special abilities, including laser beams, invincibility shields, and more. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/f41aa24e6f3354cde967683c91b7089d.poster.avif?t=1753120477\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/f41aa24e6f3354cde967683c91b7089d.webm?t=1753120477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1442050/extras/f41aa24e6f3354cde967683c91b7089d.mp4?t=1753120477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Note: The Demo version of this game only includes the &quot;endless&quot; highscore mode. Later versions will feature a more roguelike progression over various levels.<br><br>Join the game and see how far you can go!",
